<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady/weak - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady/weak - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and</p>
<p>gilts early sale traded steady to weak. Top $50.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3  230-260 lbs    48.50-50.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3  260-270 lbs    47.50-48.50</p>
<p>		270-280 lbs    46.50-47.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    38.00-41.00</p>
<p>		  over 500 lbs    46.00-49.00</p>
</text>
